[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730265228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114786#issuecomment-3730265228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114786","id":3730265228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eV1SM","user":{"login":"Clubhouse1661","id":177586398,"node_id":"U_kgDOCpXA3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177586398?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661","html_url":"https://github.com/Clubhouse1661","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clubhouse1661/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T19:19:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T19:19:00Z","body":"I think I've identified the cause. The `Window` logic clamps the new size requested by `popup(rect)` to the *current* minimum size. Since items change right before opening, the `PopupMenu` hasn't yet updated its minimum size at the `Window` level, so the window refuses to shrink below the previous (larger) size.\n\nI've fixed this by explicitly resetting the minimum size before showing the popup, and ensuring `shrink_height` is enabled. A PR is on the way.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bd0361c-89fa-4dc6-84e6-7d7f192ed489","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730265228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]